# UGREEN DXP NAS — patches on top of upstream Linux kernel it87 driver
#
# Base:   drivers/hwmon/it87.c from torvalds/linux (master, fetched 2026-07-20)
# Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/torvalds/linux/master/drivers/hwmon/it87.c
#
# To regenerate it87.c from mainline:
#   curl -fsSL \
#     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/torvalds/linux/master/drivers/hwmon/it87.c \
#     -o it87.c
#   patch it87.c < ugreen-patches.patch
#
# Patches included:
#   1. Add IT8613E device ID, chip data, enum entry, and GPIO probing
#   2. Add FEAT_11MV_ADC (11 mV ADC resolution for IT8613E)
#   3. Add IT87_REG_PWM_ALT (alternate PWM4/PWM5 registers for IT8613E/IT8622E)
#   4. Add per-chip data->REG_PWM pointer so the correct PWM table is used
#   5. Fix PWM manual-mode detection for chips without FAN_CTL ON/OFF
#      (Fixes IT8613E on UGREEN DXP NAS: pwmconfig was reporting
#       "Manual control mode not supported" because duty==max shadowed
#       the manual-mode bit.)
#   6. Fix IT8790E ADC resolution: FEAT_12MV_ADC → FEAT_10_9MV_ADC
#   7. Fix temp sysfs visibility: if (a==3) → if (i<3 && a!=3)
#   8. Drop redundant fan speed floor clamp (if val<0; kstrtol already
#      rejects negative strings before this point)
#   9. Modernise sysfs show callbacks: sprintf → sysfs_emit
#

